<title>FRANCE: AGF sells 11.3 stake in Geophysique.</title>
<headline>AGF sells 11.3 stake in Geophysique.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurance company AGF said on Wednesday it sold its 11.3 percent stake, made of 435,405 shares, in Cie Generale de Geophysique for a capital gain of 43 million francs.</p>
</text>
